{
 "area": "park",
 "description": "the little park at night: paper lanterns along the path, a pond with the moon in it, lily pads and the frog, a bench with a blanket under a big climbable tree (three mossy pads up to a crook, the birdhouse), the swing, closed moonflowers, fireflies, bushes with the shy grey kitten, string lights, houses beyond",
 "size_m": [
  12,
  10
 ],
